== Trivia ==
* The Rainmaker's name is a reference to the traditional ritual of [[Wikipedia:Rainmaking|rainmaking]] which may involve "Rain Dances".
* The Rainmaker was originally going to be omitted from Repentance, according to a [https://twitter.com/edmundmcmillen/status/1321662651055796224 Tweet from Edmund Mcmillen].
** This tweet also confirms that the Rainmaker is both male and gay.
* Defeating the Rainmaker stops the rain in the current room.

